{"video_id": "MwwCiGFyU9w", "channel_id": "UChgXDN0Dn9mjXSWculVBp-A", "fetched_at": "2026-11-16T18:51:29.324257+00:00", "fetch_tool": "yt-dlp 2026.08.19", "caption_track_type": "auto_generated", "segments": [{"start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 3.16, "text": "Hello friends. Welcome back to the"}, {"start_seconds": 2.12, "end_seconds": 5.12, "text": "channel."}, {"start_seconds": 3.16, "end_seconds": 6.88, "text": "Imagine you open Instagram."}, {"start_seconds": 5.12, "end_seconds": 8.88, "text": "You tap on a profile."}, {"start_seconds": 6.88, "end_seconds": 11.68, "text": "And within milliseconds"}, {"start_seconds": 8.88, "end_seconds": 14.24, "text": "the profile appears. No loading, no"}, {"start_seconds": 11.68, "end_seconds": 16.72, "text": "waiting. Almost instant."}, {"start_seconds": 14.24, "end_seconds": 19.36, "text": "Now think about this. That profile data"}, {"start_seconds": 16.72, "end_seconds": 20.84, "text": "already exists inside a database. So why"}, {"start_seconds": 19.36, "end_seconds": 22.8, "text": "doesn't Instagram simply ask the"}, {"start_seconds": 20.84, "end_seconds": 24.44, "text": "database every single time?"}, {"start_seconds": 22.8, "end_seconds": 25.68, "text": "Why do companies place Redis [music] in"}, {"start_seconds": 24.44, "end_seconds": 27.4, "text": "between?"}, {"start_seconds": 25.68, "end_seconds": 29.36, "text": "And what exactly happens when the data"}, {"start_seconds": 27.4, "end_seconds": 31.04, "text": "is not inside Redis?"}, {"start_seconds": 29.36, "end_seconds": 33.04, "text": "Today we're going to understand one of"}, {"start_seconds": 31.04, "end_seconds": 35.96, "text": "the most important caching patterns used"}, {"start_seconds": 33.04, "end_seconds": 37.76, "text": "in real systems. Cache-aside pattern."}, {"start_seconds": 35.96, "end_seconds": 39.6, "text": "And trust me."}, {"start_seconds": 37.76, "end_seconds": 41.24, "text": "By the end of this video"}, {"start_seconds": 39.6, "end_seconds": 43.08, "text": "you will understand exactly how"}, {"start_seconds": 41.24, "end_seconds": 45.16, "text": "applications use Redis to reduce"}, {"start_seconds": 43.08, "end_seconds": 47.08, "text": "database load and serve millions of"}, {"start_seconds": 45.16, "end_seconds": 48.84, "text": "users faster."}, {"start_seconds": 47.08, "end_seconds": 50.6, "text": "Let's begin."}, {"start_seconds": 48.84, "end_seconds": 53.28, "text": "The problem."}, {"start_seconds": 50.6, "end_seconds": 55.68, "text": "Imagine we have a simple application."}, {"start_seconds": 53.28, "end_seconds": 57.96, "text": "A user opens a profile page."}, {"start_seconds": 55.68, "end_seconds": 60.36, "text": "The request reaches the back-end server."}, {"start_seconds": 57.96, "end_seconds": 62.28, "text": "The back-end asks the database."}, {"start_seconds": 60.36, "end_seconds": 64.28, "text": "The database returns the data. The"}, {"start_seconds": 62.28, "end_seconds": 65.4, "text": "back-end sends the response."}, {"start_seconds": 64.28, "end_seconds": 68.04, "text": "Simple."}, {"start_seconds": 65.4, "end_seconds": 70.32, "text": "Now another user opens the same profile."}, {"start_seconds": 68.04, "end_seconds": 72.8, "text": "Again, the back-end asks the database."}, {"start_seconds": 70.32, "end_seconds": 74.68, "text": "Again, the database returns the data."}, {"start_seconds": 72.8, "end_seconds": 76.32, "text": "And this keeps happening."}, {"start_seconds": 74.68, "end_seconds": 78.16, "text": "Hundreds of times."}, {"start_seconds": 76.32, "end_seconds": 80.64, "text": "Thousands of times."}, {"start_seconds": 78.16, "end_seconds": 82.16, "text": "Maybe even millions of times."}, {"start_seconds": 80.64, "end_seconds": 84.64, "text": "Now ask yourself."}, {"start_seconds": 82.16, "end_seconds": 85.92, "text": "What is the real problem?"}, {"start_seconds": 84.64, "end_seconds": 87.64, "text": "The same information is being [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 85.92, "end_seconds": 90.32, "text": "fetched again and again."}, {"start_seconds": 87.64, "end_seconds": 92.32, "text": "The database is repeating the same work."}, {"start_seconds": 90.32, "end_seconds": 93.64, "text": "And as traffic grows"}, {"start_seconds": 92.32, "end_seconds": 95.24, "text": "the database starts becoming a"}, {"start_seconds": 93.64, "end_seconds": 97.72, "text": "bottleneck."}, {"start_seconds": 95.24, "end_seconds": 99.44, "text": "So engineers ask a simple question."}, {"start_seconds": 97.72, "end_seconds": 101.0, "text": "Can we store frequently used data"}, {"start_seconds": 99.44, "end_seconds": 104.12, "text": "somewhere faster?"}, {"start_seconds": 101.0, "end_seconds": 106.92, "text": "That is where Redis enters the picture."}, {"start_seconds": 104.12, "end_seconds": 109.04, "text": "What is cache-aside?"}, {"start_seconds": 106.92, "end_seconds": 111.16, "text": "Think of Redis as a super fast storage"}, {"start_seconds": 109.04, "end_seconds": 112.01, "text": "layer. Much faster than querying a"}, {"start_seconds": 111.16, "end_seconds": 112.24, "text": "database."}, {"start_seconds": 112.01, "end_seconds": 113.64, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 112.24, "end_seconds": 115.44, "text": ">> Instead of directly going to the"}, {"start_seconds": 113.64, "end_seconds": 117.4, "text": "database every time"}, {"start_seconds": 115.44, "end_seconds": 120.88, "text": "we first check Redis."}, {"start_seconds": 117.4, "end_seconds": 122.6, "text": "And this idea leads us to cache-aside."}, {"start_seconds": 120.88, "end_seconds": 124.84, "text": "Cache-aside is one of the most popular"}, {"start_seconds": 122.6, "end_seconds": 127.0, "text": "caching patterns used today."}, {"start_seconds": 124.84, "end_seconds": 129.24, "text": "The application controls everything."}, {"start_seconds": 127.0, "end_seconds": 130.52, "text": "The application decides when to read"}, {"start_seconds": 129.24, "end_seconds": 132.88, "text": "from cache,"}, {"start_seconds": 130.52, "end_seconds": 135.24, "text": "when to read from database, and when to"}, {"start_seconds": 132.88, "end_seconds": 136.4, "text": "update cache. The cache sits beside the"}, {"start_seconds": 135.24, "end_seconds": 139.24, "text": "database,"}, {"start_seconds": 136.4, "end_seconds": 141.48, "text": "which is why it is called cache-aside."}, {"start_seconds": 139.24, "end_seconds": 144.28, "text": "First request. Now, let's follow a real"}, {"start_seconds": 141.48, "end_seconds": 146.44, "text": "request. Imagine a user opens a profile"}, {"start_seconds": 144.28, "end_seconds": 149.4, "text": "page. The request reaches the back-end"}, {"start_seconds": 146.44, "end_seconds": 150.6, "text": "server. The back-end first checks Redis."}, {"start_seconds": 149.4, "end_seconds": 152.84, "text": "It asks,"}, {"start_seconds": 150.6, "end_seconds": 155.2, "text": "\"Do I already have this profile?\""}, {"start_seconds": 152.84, "end_seconds": 157.36, "text": "Suppose Redis doesn't have it."}, {"start_seconds": 155.2, "end_seconds": 158.51, "text": "The data is missing. This situation is"}, {"start_seconds": 157.36, "end_seconds": 158.68, "text": "called a cache miss."}, {"start_seconds": 158.51, "end_seconds": 160.8, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 158.68, "end_seconds": 162.76, "text": ">> The cache was checked, but the data was"}, {"start_seconds": 160.8, "end_seconds": 165.44, "text": "not found. So, now the back-end has no"}, {"start_seconds": 162.76, "end_seconds": 167.88, "text": "choice. It must go to the database. The"}, {"start_seconds": 165.44, "end_seconds": 170.28, "text": "back-end sends a query to the database."}, {"start_seconds": 167.88, "end_seconds": 171.61, "text": "The database finds the profile, returns"}, {"start_seconds": 170.28, "end_seconds": 171.8, "text": "the profile information."}, {"start_seconds": 171.61, "end_seconds": 174.12, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 171.8, "end_seconds": 176.12, "text": ">> The back-end receives the data."}, {"start_seconds": 174.12, "end_seconds": 178.48, "text": "Now, something important happens."}, {"start_seconds": 176.12, "end_seconds": 180.24, "text": "Before sending the response,"}, {"start_seconds": 178.48, "end_seconds": 181.88, "text": "the back-end stores a copy of that data"}, {"start_seconds": 180.24, "end_seconds": 183.08, "text": "inside Redis."}, {"start_seconds": 181.88, "end_seconds": 184.96, "text": "Why?"}, {"start_seconds": 183.08, "end_seconds": 186.52, "text": "Because future requests may ask for the"}, {"start_seconds": 184.96, "end_seconds": 189.24, "text": "same information."}, {"start_seconds": 186.52, "end_seconds": 191.08, "text": "So, Redis now contains the profile."}, {"start_seconds": 189.24, "end_seconds": 192.76, "text": "After storing it,"}, {"start_seconds": 191.08, "end_seconds": 195.92, "text": "the back-end sends the response to the"}, {"start_seconds": 192.76, "end_seconds": 197.88, "text": "user, and the request is complete."}, {"start_seconds": 195.92, "end_seconds": 200.16, "text": "The first request was slower"}, {"start_seconds": 197.88, "end_seconds": 202.36, "text": "because it needed a database query."}, {"start_seconds": 200.16, "end_seconds": 203.96, "text": "But now Redis has the data, and that"}, {"start_seconds": 202.36, "end_seconds": 206.33, "text": "changes everything."}, {"start_seconds": 203.96, "end_seconds": 206.76, "text": "Second request, a few seconds later,"}, {"start_seconds": 206.33, "end_seconds": 208.88, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 206.76, "end_seconds": 211.08, "text": ">> another request arrives. Again, the"}, {"start_seconds": 208.88, "end_seconds": 212.88, "text": "back-end checks Redis, but this time"}, {"start_seconds": 211.08, "end_seconds": 213.08, "text": "Redis already contains the data."}, {"start_seconds": 212.88, "end_seconds": 215.32, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 213.08, "end_seconds": 218.2, "text": ">> Redis immediately returns the result. No"}, {"start_seconds": 215.32, "end_seconds": 220.44, "text": "database query. No disk access. No"}, {"start_seconds": 218.2, "end_seconds": 223.04, "text": "expensive operation."}, {"start_seconds": 220.44, "end_seconds": 224.88, "text": "The response returns almost instantly."}, {"start_seconds": 223.04, "end_seconds": 227.29, "text": "This is called a cache hit,"}, {"start_seconds": 224.88, "end_seconds": 227.4, "text": "and this is exactly what engineers want"}, {"start_seconds": 227.29, "end_seconds": 229.52, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 227.4, "end_seconds": 231.36, "text": ">> because cache hits are fast,"}, {"start_seconds": 229.52, "end_seconds": 233.44, "text": "very fast."}, {"start_seconds": 231.36, "end_seconds": 235.28, "text": "Why this is powerful."}, {"start_seconds": 233.44, "end_seconds": 237.72, "text": "Now, think about what happened."}, {"start_seconds": 235.28, "end_seconds": 239.48, "text": "The first request touched the database."}, {"start_seconds": 237.72, "end_seconds": 241.24, "text": "The second request did not."}, {"start_seconds": 239.48, "end_seconds": 242.84, "text": "The third request did not."}, {"start_seconds": 241.24, "end_seconds": 244.32, "text": "Maybe the next thousand requests never"}, {"start_seconds": 242.84, "end_seconds": 244.48, "text": "touch the database."}, {"start_seconds": 244.32, "end_seconds": 246.12, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 244.48, "end_seconds": 248.4, "text": ">> One database query,"}, {"start_seconds": 246.12, "end_seconds": 250.84, "text": "thousands of cache reads."}, {"start_seconds": 248.4, "end_seconds": 253.28, "text": "That is a huge performance improvement."}, {"start_seconds": 250.84, "end_seconds": 254.8, "text": "Database load decreases. Response speed"}, {"start_seconds": 253.28, "end_seconds": 257.28, "text": "increases."}, {"start_seconds": 254.8, "end_seconds": 259.96, "text": "And users get a much better experience."}, {"start_seconds": 257.28, "end_seconds": 261.84, "text": "This is why caching is so powerful."}, {"start_seconds": 259.96, "end_seconds": 264.12, "text": "But, there is a problem now."}, {"start_seconds": 261.84, "end_seconds": 266.32, "text": "Another important question appears."}, {"start_seconds": 264.12, "end_seconds": 269.04, "text": "What happens when the data changes?"}, {"start_seconds": 266.32, "end_seconds": 271.52, "text": "Suppose the user updates their bio"}, {"start_seconds": 269.04, "end_seconds": 272.96, "text": "or changes their profile picture."}, {"start_seconds": 271.52, "end_seconds": 275.52, "text": "The database now contains new"}, {"start_seconds": 272.96, "end_seconds": 277.0, "text": "information, but Redis may still contain"}, {"start_seconds": 275.52, "end_seconds": 278.72, "text": "old information."}, {"start_seconds": 277.0, "end_seconds": 281.56, "text": "That means users could see outdated"}, {"start_seconds": 278.72, "end_seconds": 283.24, "text": "data, and that is a problem. So, how do"}, {"start_seconds": 281.56, "end_seconds": 284.96, "text": "we fix it?"}, {"start_seconds": 283.24, "end_seconds": 286.84, "text": "Cache invalidation."}, {"start_seconds": 284.96, "end_seconds": 288.28, "text": "Whenever the data changes,"}, {"start_seconds": 286.84, "end_seconds": 289.6, "text": "the application first updates the"}, {"start_seconds": 288.28, "end_seconds": 291.48, "text": "database,"}, {"start_seconds": 289.6, "end_seconds": 292.76, "text": "then it removes the old cache entry from"}, {"start_seconds": 291.48, "end_seconds": 294.12, "text": "Redis."}, {"start_seconds": 292.76, "end_seconds": 295.44, "text": "This process is called cache"}, {"start_seconds": 294.12, "end_seconds": 297.8, "text": "invalidation."}, {"start_seconds": 295.44, "end_seconds": 300.32, "text": "Now, Redis no longer has the old data."}, {"start_seconds": 297.8, "end_seconds": 302.08, "text": "The next request becomes a cache miss."}, {"start_seconds": 300.32, "end_seconds": 303.88, "text": "The backend fetches fresh data from the"}, {"start_seconds": 302.08, "end_seconds": 306.16, "text": "database, [music] stores the fresh"}, {"start_seconds": 303.88, "end_seconds": 307.2, "text": "version in Redis, and everything becomes"}, {"start_seconds": 306.16, "end_seconds": 307.36, "text": "correct again."}, {"start_seconds": 307.2, "end_seconds": 308.48, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 307.36, "end_seconds": 310.8, "text": ">> Simple,"}, {"start_seconds": 308.48, "end_seconds": 313.92, "text": "but extremely important."}, {"start_seconds": 310.8, "end_seconds": 316.28, "text": "Let's quickly recap. A request arrives."}, {"start_seconds": 313.92, "end_seconds": 317.48, "text": "The backend checks Redis. If the data"}, {"start_seconds": 316.28, "end_seconds": 320.24, "text": "exists,"}, {"start_seconds": 317.48, "end_seconds": 323.12, "text": "cache hit, return immediately. [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 320.24, "end_seconds": 325.52, "text": "If the data doesn't exist, cache miss."}, {"start_seconds": 323.12, "end_seconds": 328.36, "text": "Go to the database. Get the data. Store"}, {"start_seconds": 325.52, "end_seconds": 330.4, "text": "a copy in Redis. Return the response."}, {"start_seconds": 328.36, "end_seconds": 332.0, "text": "And if the data changes later,"}, {"start_seconds": 330.4, "end_seconds": 333.56, "text": "invalidate the cache."}, {"start_seconds": 332.0, "end_seconds": 335.52, "text": "So, future requests receive fresh"}, {"start_seconds": 333.56, "end_seconds": 336.67, "text": "information. That is the complete"}, {"start_seconds": 335.52, "end_seconds": 337.12, "text": "cache-aside pattern."}, {"start_seconds": 336.67, "end_seconds": 339.16, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 337.12, "end_seconds": 340.96, "text": ">> Simple, powerful,"}, {"start_seconds": 339.16, "end_seconds": 342.12, "text": "and used by countless applications every"}, {"start_seconds": 340.96, "end_seconds": 344.36, "text": "day."}, {"start_seconds": 342.12, "end_seconds": 346.04, "text": "Outro. Today, we learned how real"}, {"start_seconds": 344.36, "end_seconds": 349.0, "text": "applications use Redis to reduce"}, {"start_seconds": 346.04, "end_seconds": 351.56, "text": "database load. We learned cache hits,"}, {"start_seconds": 349.0, "end_seconds": 353.05, "text": "cache misses, why Redis sits between the"}, {"start_seconds": 351.56, "end_seconds": 353.36, "text": "application and the database,"}, {"start_seconds": 353.05, "end_seconds": 355.12, "text": ">> [music]"}, {"start_seconds": 353.36, "end_seconds": 356.92, "text": ">> and how cache aside actually works"}, {"start_seconds": 355.12, "end_seconds": 358.4, "text": "behind the scenes."}, {"start_seconds": 356.92, "end_seconds": 359.8, "text": "But now another interesting question"}, {"start_seconds": 358.4, "end_seconds": 361.6, "text": "appears."}, {"start_seconds": 359.8, "end_seconds": 364.0, "text": "What happens when millions of users"}, {"start_seconds": 361.6, "end_seconds": 366.04, "text": "request the same data at exactly the"}, {"start_seconds": 364.0, "end_seconds": 368.84, "text": "same moment?"}, {"start_seconds": 366.04, "end_seconds": 370.64, "text": "And the cache suddenly expires?"}, {"start_seconds": 368.84, "end_seconds": 371.72, "text": "That leads us directly into our next"}, {"start_seconds": 370.64, "end_seconds": 373.4, "text": "topic."}, {"start_seconds": 371.72, "end_seconds": 374.6, "text": "Cache [music] stampede."}, {"start_seconds": 373.4, "end_seconds": 376.6, "text": "And trust me."}, {"start_seconds": 374.6, "end_seconds": 378.12, "text": "Things get very interesting from there."}, {"start_seconds": 376.6, "end_seconds": 381.36, "text": "Thank you for watching."}, {"start_seconds": 378.12, "end_seconds": 381.36, "text": "See you in the next video."}]}